{
  "name": "RSS feed to every social account with Ampost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RSS feed to every social account\nEach new item of a feed (blog, podcast, changelog) becomes a post with its title and link.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the **n8n-nodes-ampost** community node (Settings → Community nodes).\n2. Create an Ampost credential with an API key from ampost.io → Settings → API keys.\n3. Put your feed in **New feed item**.\n4. In **Share the item**, pick every platform in the **Platforms** list (it lists the platforms with a connected account).\n5. Activate the workflow. Only items published after activation are shared.\n\nThe Idempotency-Key comes from the item, so the same item never posts twice.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "3686a02e-8a48-408f-abce-903254507319",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyHour"
            }
          ]
        },
        "feedUrl": "https://example.com/feed.xml"
      },
      "id": "e9e20509-c1c5-4a16-ae3a-cb248782c05b",
      "name": "New feed item",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedReadTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "platforms": [
          "bluesky",
          "threads"
        ],
        "text": "={{ $json.title }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "idempotencyKey": "=rss-{{ ($json.guid || $json.link).hash('sha256').slice(0, 40) }}",
          "linkUrl": "={{ /^https?:\\/\\//.test($json.link || '') ? $json.link : '' }}"
        },
        "platformOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "a22872b9-f1d2-4121-a2e3-84b007a62eec",
      "name": "Share the item",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New feed item": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Share the item",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
